OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA cloudy and
OL,6,Fwindy evening with outbreaks of rain.
OL,7,FBecoming mostly dry overnight with
OL,8,Fwinds easing down but a few showers
OL,9,Fcontinuing in the southwest.
OL,10,
OL,11,CThursday:FIt will be a mostly dry day
OL,12,Fwith bright spells developing. The odd
OL,13,Fshower around, mainly in the southwest
OL,14,Fin the morning.
OL,15,
OL,16,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRather
OL,17,Funsettled with with showers or longer
OL,18,Fspells of rain at times but also some
OL,19,Fdrier and brighter interludes.
